# Streamlit Secrets Template for Fiber Maintenance Analytics System
# =====================================================================
# 
# FOR STREAMLIT CLOUD DEPLOYMENT:
# 1. Go to your Streamlit Cloud dashboard
# 2. Select your app
# 3. Click "Settings" → "Secrets"
# 4. Copy the contents below and paste into the secrets editor
# 5. Replace placeholder values with your actual database credentials
#
# FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# 1. Copy this file to: .streamlit/secrets.toml
# 2. Fill in your actual credentials
# 3. NEVER commit secrets.toml to git (it's already in .gitignore)
#
# =====================================================================

